 tiles; stone surfaces made from natural stones such as marble, limestone, and granite; engineered stones; and mosaic tiles, as well as bathware and kitchenware products. It also provides stones; moderica; faucets; decor covering; and accessories. The company was founded in 1990 and is headquartered in Johor Bahru, Malaysia.","zh":"BMS Holdings Berhad 通过其子公司在马来西亚从事瓷砖和石材表面的零售、批发及项目销售业务。公司成立于1990年，总部位于马来西亚新山。","lines":["瓷砖产品：提供瓷质砖和陶瓷砖，面向零售、批发及项目客户。","石材表面：销售由大理石、石灰石和花岗岩等天然石材制成的石材表面以及人造石。","马赛克与装饰：提供马赛克瓷砖、装饰覆盖材料及相关配件。","卫浴与厨房用品：销售卫浴洁具和厨房用品。","水龙头与配件：提供水龙头及各类配件。"],"lines_en":["Tiles: Offers porcelain and ceramic tiles for retail, wholesale, and project customers.","Stone surfaces: Sells stone surfaces made from natural stones such as marble, limestone, and granite, as well as engineered stones.","Mosaic and decor: Provides mosaic tiles, decor covering, and related accessories.","Bathware and kitchenware: Offers bathware and kitchenware products.","Faucets and accessories: Supplies faucets and various accessories."]}}